      "question": "Find the mean deviation about the mean for the data: 6, 7, 10, 12, 13, 4, 8, 12.",
      "finalAnswer": "2.75",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "Mean $\\bar{x} = \\frac{6+7+10+12+13+4+8+12}{8} = \\frac{72}{8} = 9$.",
        "Deviations $|x_i - 9|$: 3, 2, 1, 3, 4, 5, 1, 3.",
        "Sum of deviations = 22.",
        "Mean Deviation = $22/8 = 2.75$."
      ]
    },
