      "question": "<strong>Case Study:</strong> Two dice are thrown simultaneously. The sample space has 36 outcomes.<br>(i) Find the probability of getting a sum of 8.<br>(ii) Find the probability of getting a sum of 13.<br>(iii) Find the probability of getting a doublet (same number on both dice).",
